<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="426502173"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1140032113"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Stay Alive"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="高橋李依"/><amll:meta key="album" value="TVアニメ「Re：ゼロから始める異世界生活」後期エンディングテーマ「Stay Alive」 歌：エミリア（CV：高橋李依）"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:25.461"><div begin="00:14.858" end="04:17.920"><p begin="00:14.858" end="00:18.087" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">未完成のパズル<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尚未拼成的拼图</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ka n se i no pa zu ru</span></p><p begin="00:19.128" end="00:25.291" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">どうしてだろう? 何かが足りない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知缘由为何</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u shi te da ro u ?</span></p><p begin="00:28.557" end="00:31.324" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">行き違いの運命<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明知你我本就注定分道扬镳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki chi ga i no u n me i</span></p><p begin="00:32.845" end="00:40.182" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">離れてゆくことも 知りながら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你亦终将远离我而去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na re te yu ku ko to mo shi ri na ga ra</span></p><p begin="00:42.491" end="00:45.381" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">また歩く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还是会义无反顾继续前行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta a ru ku</span></p><p begin="00:47.538" end="00:53.802" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">I Stay Alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">I Stay Alive 如今却徘徊在无尽的黑暗之中</span></p><p begin="00:54.520" end="01:01.212" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">今は一人 闇をさまようだけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今只剩我独自一人彷徨黑暗中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma wa hi to ri ya mi wo sa ma yo u da ke</span></p><p begin="01:01.718" end="01:12.573" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">想定外の切なさが 胸の中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而让我始料未及的是那份悲痛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u te i ga i no se tsu na sa ga</span></p><p begin="01:13.857" end="01:16.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">消えぬままで</p><p begin="01:30.272" end="01:33.373" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">不安定なシーソー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我分坐在不稳的跷跷板两端</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu a n te i na shi i so o</span></p><p begin="01:34.554" end="01:41.063" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">離れすぎて 片方見えない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为相隔太远而无法将你看清</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na re su gi te ka ta ho u mi e na i</span></p><p begin="01:44.053" end="01:48.939" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">目印さえないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连零碎的印记都不曾留存</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me ji ru shi sa e na i ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:49.716" end="01:55.792" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">ふっと目を閉じては<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">蓦然间我轻轻闭上双眸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu 't to me wo to ji te wa</span></p><p begin="01:57.930" end="02:00.928" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">また祈る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再一次静静地祈祷</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta i no ru</span></p><p begin="02:03.018" end="02:09.115" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">Oh, Stay Alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Oh Stay Alive 如今 你正在思考着什么呢吧?</span></p><p begin="02:09.890" end="02:14.036" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">今はどんなことを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma wa do n na ko to wo</span></p><p begin="02:14.525" end="02:16.463" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">思ってるのでしょう?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你抱持着怎样的想法？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo 't te ru no de sho u ?</span></p><p begin="02:17.211" end="02:28.085" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">泣いていないけど 一人はやっぱり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然并没有落下泪水</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na i te i na i ke do</span></p><p begin="02:29.196" end="02:31.966" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">寂しくってさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">果然还是很寂寞啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa bi shi ku 't te sa</span></p><p begin="02:37.359" end="02:41.812" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">ずっと祈った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自始至终默默祈祷</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to i no 't ta</span></p><p begin="02:44.898" end="02:46.973" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">Stay Alive</p><p begin="02:48.435" end="02:50.563" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">Stay Alive</p><p begin="02:51.764" end="02:55.374" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Stay Alive …</p><p begin="03:13.096" end="03:16.293" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">未完成のパズル<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尚未拼成的拼图</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ka n se i no pa zu ru</span></p><p begin="03:20.098" end="03:23.032" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">うまくいかなくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍未寻回完美契合的那一角</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ma ku i ka na ku te</span></p><p begin="03:26.924" end="03:31.751" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">音も無い澄んだ風に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悄无声息澄澈的清风</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o to mo na i su n da ka ze ni</span></p><p begin="03:34.396" end="03:37.021" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">心揺らす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拂动着我的心弦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro yu ra su</span></p><p begin="03:39.128" end="03:45.254" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">I Stay Alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">I Stay Alive 在此处又在做着什么呢?</span></p><p begin="03:46.017" end="03:52.128" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">今はどこで何をしてるの?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而现在我究竟在此处做什么呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma wa do ko de na ni wo shi te ru no ?</span></p><p begin="03:53.169" end="04:04.227" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">想定外の切なさが 胸の中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而让我始料未及的是那份悲痛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u te i ga i no se tsu na sa ga</span></p><p begin="04:05.154" end="04:09.867" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">消えぬままで</p><p begin="04:14.128" end="04:17.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">Stay Alive</p></div></body></tt>